 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Make an appointment",
   "texto": [
    "To propose a moment you can ask **Vous êtes libre mardi ?** (Is it free on Tuesday?) or **On se voit à dix heures ?** (See you at ten?).",
    "To accept: **Oui, ça me va** (yes, I do well). To confirm: **C'est confirmé** (confirmed).",
    "In a formal situation you can order an appointment with **Je voudrais prendre rendez-vous** (I would like to ask for an appointment). Learn this phrase as a useful expression."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Change or cancel",
   "texto": [
    "To propose another moment: **On peut reporter à jeudi ?** (Can we change it to Thursday?).",
    "To cancel: **Je dois annuler le rendez-vous** (I have to cancel the appointment). **Désolé(e)** = sorry; **merci** = thank you."
   ]
  },
